        "message": "v1.0.79: fix translation failures (network retry + MyMemory URL + mismatch guard)\n\nRoot causes found in device log (livecap.log in YouTube sandbox):\n1. agnes gateway intermittent timeout (-1001 / kCFStreamError -2102):\n   249 failures vs 78 successes -> 'always English'.\n   Now: retry same provider up to 2 extra times with 0.8s/1.6s backoff\n   on network-class errors (timeout/lost/connect/DNS).\n2. MyMemory always failed with -1002 (unsupported URL):\n   langpair separator '|' is a reserved URL char and was not\n   percent-encoded -> NSURL rejected the whole request.\n   Now: '|' encoded as %7C, so the free fallback actually works.\n3. Translation still mismatched with the English line:\n   translation returned 1-3s later; if ASR had produced a new\n   sentence meanwhile, the Chinese of the old sentence was shown\n   against the new English.\n   Now: track _lastRequestedOrigin and drop the translation unless\n   the requested text and the current text are the same sentence\n   (equal / prefix / first 40 chars match).\n\nAlso fixes 3-second stale cache window that showed a mismatched pair.",
